M9 (VOUT VBP VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R0 (VDD net0) resistor r=1k
R1 (net6 Start) resistor r=1k
R2 (net4 net1) resistor r=1k
